# A name computed sent to `self` in a module or a base class reaches the
# methods of every class that includes or inherits it, in any file; it
# lowered only its own file, so Host#plain and Sub#other came out clear.
# A block's parameter hides the method's local of its name (Panel), and a
# shape written under a condition leaves the name it may not replace
# (Socket): each is a name computed, not the shape.
# A name a send of a send hands on is a call of it from any file (Valve).
# One the index records no symbol for, an operator or a string, lowers the
# method of its name from any file (Grid).
dead app Host#plain=unreferenced~Mixin Sub#other=unreferenced~Base Unrelated#lonely=unreferenced~ Panel#other_w=unreferenced~Panel Socket#other_g=unreferenced~Socket Valve#relayed=single-caller Grid#[]=single-caller~:[] Grid#+=unreferenced~:+ Grid#spelled=unreferenced~spelled Grid#unsent=unreferenced~
